# @name: sed-awk | Print Range of Lines (023)
# @description: Prints a range of lines Group: Awk Basic Operations. Template: replace placeholders before running. {start} = Starting line number [default "1"] | {end} = Ending line number [default "10"] | {file} = Path to the file
awk 'NR>={start} && NR<={end}' {file}